cipality_name":"富加町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[136.98615,35.487753]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"半布ヶ丘公園","category":"nature","address":"加茂郡富加町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"21502","municipality_pref":"岐阜県","municipality_name":"富加町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[136.9875,35.48787]}}],"display_comment_original":"富加町周辺には、近世村の記憶として大平賀村、川小牧村、加治田村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、加治田城跡、東山浦遺跡、海老山遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、大平賀村、川小牧村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["佐藤忠能","佐藤忠康","長沼三徳","長沼藤治兵衛"],"notable_people":["佐藤忠能","佐藤忠康","長沼三徳","長沼藤治兵衛","大島光義"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["加治田城跡","堂洞城跡","井高1号古墳","東山浦遺跡","恵日山遺跡","半布里遺跡（東山浦遺跡）","稲荷山古墳","閏田古墳"],"specialties":["古代米","黒米","赤米","古代米を使用した饅頭（紅ごま・穂の香・紫の舞い）","堂上蜂屋柿","美濃ヘルシーポーク（銘柄推進協議会）"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%8C%E5%8A%A0%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11384002","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11383998","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11653194","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11653226","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11434856","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17226639","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11383873","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11373548","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11579922","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11538912","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11475788","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q45829496","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11090427","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11500558"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"富加町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109949172","wikidata_qid":"Q1203855","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%8C%E5%8A%A0%E7%94